# Shell scripts and vhs tapes must stay LF in the repo. On a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true, `git add` would otherwise store CRLF, and a script
# committed that way dies in Linux/Docker with "bad interpreter: no such file
# or directory" on the shebang.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.tape text eol=lf

# Rendered demo assets are binary — never touch line endings or diff them.
*.gif binary
*.png binary
